WEBVTT

00:01.470 --> 00:04.850
So, like, ever since Morishige
was dumped by Miura,

00:04.850 --> 00:07.360
he's been texting Hiroko nonstop.

00:07.360 --> 00:09.800
What? Ew.

00:09.800 --> 00:12.380
I guess Matsuzaki is single now, too.

00:12.790 --> 00:16.740
Oh, yeah. Hey, Tsubomi.
Wanna go to karaoke after school?

00:16.740 --> 00:21.200
Huh? Uh, sorry, I'm actually
a bit under the weather.

00:21.200 --> 00:22.140
I'll pass.

00:22.140 --> 00:25.660
Huh? Really? You should hang out
with us every once in a while.

00:28.470 --> 00:31.420
Oh, shit! Snot just exploded everywhere!

00:31.420 --> 00:34.660
Come on. You don't have to
sing, so just come with us.

00:35.780 --> 00:39.220
Maybe next time.
Hey, do you two have any tissues?

00:39.220 --> 00:40.320
Nope.

00:41.330 --> 00:45.640
I'm going to go throw this in the garbage,
so put the cleaning tools away for me.

00:45.640 --> 00:49.440
We'll go with you. Let's walk slow
so we can kill some time.

00:50.440 --> 00:52.260
Why are you covering your face?

00:52.260 --> 00:53.840
Hm? Oh, no reason.

00:53.840 --> 00:55.420
Wait, what is it? I'm so curious now.

00:55.420 --> 00:56.900
Come on, move your hand!

00:57.170 --> 01:03.350
O-Oh, no... If they see my
face covered in snot...

01:04.640 --> 01:08.050
Wanna see a picture of Takane Tsubomi's
face just covered in snot from yesterday?

01:08.320 --> 01:10.580
Ew, gross!

01:10.580 --> 01:11.900
Oh, crap!

01:11.900 --> 01:13.550
You can't be serious!

01:13.550 --> 01:16.250
That's bound to happen.

01:16.540 --> 01:18.500
Hey, you two...

01:20.330 --> 01:22.930
The teacher was looking for you.

01:22.930 --> 01:25.230
Ugh, lame.

01:25.230 --> 01:26.960
Well, this sucks.

01:30.240 --> 01:32.070
Wait, Tsubomi.

01:32.820 --> 01:35.570
Sorry, now's not a good time.

01:35.920 --> 01:37.750
Here you go. Some tissues.

01:44.580 --> 01:47.410
Thank you so much, Mob.

01:47.410 --> 01:49.180
Oh, sure.

01:49.590 --> 01:54.270
You know, it's been a
while since we talked.

01:54.610 --> 01:55.440
Yeah.

01:56.230 --> 01:57.300
Thanks.

01:57.720 --> 01:59.390
Well, I'll see you later.

01:59.390 --> 02:00.470
See you later?!

02:00.470 --> 02:02.848
(See you later)

02:10.090 --> 02:11.180
Mob!

02:13.960 --> 02:15.570
You got a second?

02:15.570 --> 02:16.640
Mezato.

02:16.640 --> 02:19.150
On Sunday night,

02:19.150 --> 02:23.120
there's going to be a huge gathering
for the Psycho Helmet Religion.

02:23.120 --> 02:24.610
Will you come?

02:24.980 --> 02:27.540
Sorry, I'm just not interested.

02:27.540 --> 02:29.970
Please! Just for a little bit!

02:29.970 --> 02:31.660
Cough! Ahem...

02:33.010 --> 02:34.010
Erm...

02:34.810 --> 02:35.660
Tome.

02:36.040 --> 02:42.220
Mob, do you realize you promised
you'd help me find telepathists on Sunday?

02:42.450 --> 02:44.540
Oh, right...

02:45.260 --> 02:48.910
Anyway, think it over.
I'll call your house.

02:50.230 --> 02:51.790
Kageyama.

02:52.260 --> 02:54.560
Emi? What brings you here?

02:54.560 --> 02:57.370
I was just observing.
You're totally popular.

02:57.370 --> 02:59.370
Way to go, Kageyama.

02:59.560 --> 03:00.540
Sorry?

03:01.860 --> 03:05.060
Oh, look at you playing dumb.

03:05.810 --> 03:09.140
Popular? Me?

03:11.040 --> 03:15.290
But you know... I did actually
talk to a lot of girls today.

03:16.360 --> 03:20.710
And even though it wasn't for long,
I got to talk to Tsubomi alone, too.

03:21.410 --> 03:25.380
Brother! Are you heading home?
Let's walk home together.

03:26.010 --> 03:26.980
Ritsu...

03:27.920 --> 03:30.250
Would you lend me your ear for a second?

03:30.250 --> 03:31.320
What's up?

03:32.320 --> 03:33.370
I...

03:34.970 --> 03:37.200
might be getting popular...

03:37.430 --> 03:38.180
Huh?

03:38.810 --> 03:41.820
Er, sorry! Forget I ever said anything.

03:41.820 --> 03:43.360
Uh, Brother!

03:43.610 --> 03:47.410
I'm sure I just got the wrong idea again.
How embarrassing.

03:51.900 --> 03:53.930
I-I'm being watched?

03:54.520 --> 03:56.730
The girls passing by keep glancing at me?

03:57.320 --> 03:59.850
Kageyama's so hot.

04:00.650 --> 04:02.290
I'm not imagining it.

04:02.290 --> 04:04.580
They're whispering as
they glance over at me.

04:04.580 --> 04:07.593
Right? Ritsu's great and so refined.

04:07.595 --> 04:10.760
Could it be... I'm right? No...

04:10.760 --> 04:13.720
I'm definitely popular.

04:13.720 --> 04:16.180
Shigeo's so hot.

04:16.188 --> 04:17.690
(Hearing things)

04:26.740 --> 04:29.830
(Mob on a high horse 100%)

04:30.520 --> 04:34.100
Finally... Congrats, Nii-san.

04:38.320 --> 04:40.030
(MOB MOB WOW!)

04:41.160 --> 04:42.910
(MOB MOB WOW!)

04:44.080 --> 04:45.750
(MOB MOB WOW!)

04:46.910 --> 04:48.580
(MOB MOB WOW!)

04:50.000 --> 04:52.710
I realized that our youth is Grey

04:52.710 --> 04:55.630
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

04:55.710 --> 04:58.130
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

04:58.130 --> 05:01.300
Struggling through this adolescence

05:01.430 --> 05:04.260
Don't disturb my deep psyche

05:04.260 --> 05:06.930
Who is that behind you?

05:07.060 --> 05:10.730
Opposing ideas creates distortion

05:10.730 --> 05:14.150
Exorcise all the sorrow

05:14.320 --> 05:17.820
So, do what you can now

05:17.900 --> 05:19.740
My life

05:19.990 --> 05:23.870
Finally, break it down

05:25.370 --> 05:28.200
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

05:28.200 --> 05:31.080
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

05:31.080 --> 05:33.840
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

05:33.840 --> 05:36.800
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

05:36.800 --> 05:39.300
Taking things as it is

05:39.300 --> 05:42.720
In this free relation where
We resent each other

05:42.800 --> 05:45.010
Once these two become one

05:45.010 --> 05:47.020
That smile becomes one

05:47.020 --> 05:50.100
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

05:50.770 --> 05:53.770
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

05:54.110 --> 05:55.190
(MOB MOB WOW!)

05:55.190 --> 05:58.070
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

05:58.230 --> 05:59.780
"1"

05:59.780 --> 06:00.950
(MOB MOB WOW!)

06:00.950 --> 06:03.240
One and only "1"

06:05.480 --> 06:06.970
Is that the Divine Tree?

06:06.970 --> 06:08.120
It's huge!

06:08.120 --> 06:09.360
Let's take a picture!

06:09.360 --> 06:10.680
Yeah!

06:12.140 --> 06:14.180
Well? Isn't the view great?

06:14.180 --> 06:15.520
It's lovely.

06:15.520 --> 06:19.750
We're currently selling a roll cake
inspired by the Divine Tree.

06:19.750 --> 06:21.620
It might even be lucky!

06:22.430 --> 06:27.820
The Divine Tree is on our side.
It will answer our prayers!

06:28.380 --> 06:31.320
The helix of life embraced by the earth...

06:31.750 --> 06:37.060
We are nothing but tiny beings
of life says the Divine Tree.

06:38.580 --> 06:44.740
When many desires and wishes gather in
one place, a new divinity is born.

06:45.540 --> 06:51.710
This broccoli ended up becoming
the symbol of some god.

06:52.610 --> 06:55.850
Its believers' energy of desire is colossal.

06:55.850 --> 06:59.680
And with this energy, the Divine Tree
continues to grow even more.

07:00.380 --> 07:05.680
However, this thing's just a huge broccoli
and has no power to actually lead the people.

07:06.220 --> 07:12.460
So, I'll just take that
energy and put it to good use.

07:12.460 --> 07:17.880
If this world needs a god so badly,
then I'll do the shepherding myself.

07:18.280 --> 07:21.340
I'll produce a founder for the religious
organization missing theirs,

07:21.340 --> 07:26.140
the Psycho Helmet Religion.

07:28.170 --> 07:32.680
(Getting Carried Away
~100%~)

07:32.680 --> 07:34.970
Shige, you've got a phone call.

07:35.210 --> 07:36.880
It's a girl!

07:38.990 --> 07:40.150
Hello?

07:40.590 --> 07:42.390
Oh, Mezato.

07:43.700 --> 07:45.180
So you want to talk about that one thing.

07:45.600 --> 07:48.770
I keep telling you this,
but I'm not cut out for that.

07:48.770 --> 07:53.780
Wait! Things really are changing, though.

07:54.080 --> 07:56.190
Ever since the Divine Tree
showed up in our city,

07:56.190 --> 08:01.370
a bunch of people have claimed to be the
founder of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

08:01.370 --> 08:04.080
And now, they're going to hold an audition

08:04.080 --> 08:06.620
to decide on the founder.

08:06.970 --> 08:07.920
At this rate,

08:08.170 --> 08:12.540
someone else is going to end up being
the founder of the Psycho Helmet Religion!

08:12.730 --> 08:15.520
I can't let that happen!
That'd be so lame!

08:18.640 --> 08:20.550
I'll call you back from my cellphone.

08:21.300 --> 08:24.120
There are over 500,000 believers!

08:24.120 --> 08:28.060
Wouldn't it be interesting if the founder
were a second-year middle school boy?

08:28.060 --> 08:30.960
And you also happen to be a psychic!

08:30.960 --> 08:33.900
That's so mysterious and cool!

08:34.310 --> 08:37.300
I'm certain that'll make you
super popular with the girls.

08:37.780 --> 08:40.130
Even with Takane, too!

08:40.320 --> 08:41.040
Huh?

08:41.550 --> 08:42.740
What's wrong?

08:43.390 --> 08:46.490
Wait, Mezato, do you also...

08:47.220 --> 08:49.100
Er, never mind.

08:49.100 --> 08:50.210
What?

08:50.540 --> 08:55.500
Anyway, what everyone needs isn't
some phony. It's you, Mob.

08:55.830 --> 08:57.870
You need to come to founder audition, okay?

09:00.490 --> 09:02.830
Everyone needs me...

09:04.210 --> 09:07.220
Maybe it won't be so bad
to be the founder...

09:07.220 --> 09:09.020
Well said, Shigeo!

09:09.730 --> 09:11.850
Dimple?! You startled me.

09:11.850 --> 09:15.560
I haven't seen you in a while.
What happened?

09:15.560 --> 09:19.910
What happened? That's my line.
What's with the face and voice, man?

09:19.910 --> 09:21.110
What happened?

09:22.840 --> 09:24.750
I see.

09:25.180 --> 09:27.890
You got the wrong idea because
she said, "See you later."

09:28.350 --> 09:31.600
No, that's not a misunderstanding.
That's the truth.

09:31.600 --> 09:34.290
Thinking that just because
you talked to a girl

09:34.290 --> 09:36.510
happens all the time to prepubescent boys.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.810
Those stares you think you're seeing
are also a misunderstanding.

09:38.810 --> 09:43.520
Seriously, no one even notices you,
more than you can imagine.

09:43.520 --> 09:47.020
Why would you say that? You weren't there.

09:47.390 --> 09:51.060
I'm telling you this because
I care about you.

09:51.060 --> 09:53.570
You're not actually popular right now.

09:54.840 --> 09:56.790
What did you want, anyway?

09:56.790 --> 10:01.250
Good question. Oh, right.
About the founder audition!

10:01.620 --> 10:03.120
Huh? What about it?

10:03.120 --> 10:05.570
You can't just sit there quietly, can you?

10:05.570 --> 10:07.110
It's time to make our move!

10:07.110 --> 10:11.270
This is our time to rise to the top!
Let's go together.

10:11.270 --> 10:12.210
Why?

10:12.780 --> 10:13.580
Huh?

10:14.370 --> 10:17.390
This has nothing to do with you, Dimple.

10:17.390 --> 10:22.040
But the predecessor to the
Psycho Helmet Religion, (LOL),

10:22.040 --> 10:24.100
was created by me...

10:25.740 --> 10:28.510
But you gathered people there by
brainwashing them, didn't you?

10:29.280 --> 10:30.980
Apparently with the Psycho Helmet Religion,

10:30.980 --> 10:34.810
everyone gathered on their own
and they're all having fun peacefully,

10:34.810 --> 10:36.840
so getting in the way is bad.

10:36.840 --> 10:40.650
B-But having a proficient
leader is important.

10:40.650 --> 10:44.660
What those people want is someone
who has divine powers.

10:44.660 --> 10:46.610
I know.

10:48.660 --> 10:50.860
And that's why it can't be you, Dimple.

10:50.860 --> 10:54.620
The one everyone is seeking is me,
not you, Dimple.

10:55.260 --> 10:57.440
He's totally crarried away...

10:58.110 --> 11:02.220
Please. You think you have the
power to control the masses?

11:02.800 --> 11:05.710
I didn't say anything about
being their founder.

11:06.170 --> 11:08.810
I know I'm not cut out for that.

11:08.810 --> 11:10.220
And that's why

11:10.220 --> 11:16.410
if you and I join forces,
a super-elite religion will be born!

11:16.410 --> 11:17.770
Which means...

11:18.200 --> 11:21.000
It'll be the inception of a new god!

11:21.000 --> 11:23.610
So is this god you, Dimple?

11:23.610 --> 11:24.370
Er...

11:24.370 --> 11:26.160
What, exactly, do you want to do as god?

11:26.520 --> 11:28.710
I haven't decided that yet...

11:28.710 --> 11:32.620
But I'd probably end up with powers
beyond my wildest imagination.

11:33.310 --> 11:35.940
Well, I'm not interested in power,

11:35.940 --> 11:38.850
so I'm not going to be
able to help you out.

11:38.850 --> 11:42.300
Wha... Are you trying to
keep me out of this?!

11:42.660 --> 11:46.850
Keep this up, and some other
jackass is gonna take over!

11:47.060 --> 11:49.930
They're gonna keep all of this
divine energy to themselves!

11:50.520 --> 11:55.050
So the reason you're stronger now is you
stole some of the energy from the broccoli.

11:56.530 --> 11:58.680
That's fine and all, but...

11:58.680 --> 12:02.100
You're also trying to take
them over, too, aren't you?

12:02.100 --> 12:05.630
No! I'm just... You see...

12:05.630 --> 12:08.950
So what makes you different
from the other guys?

12:10.010 --> 12:11.120
Dimple...

12:11.120 --> 12:14.200
Why don't you give
your schemes a rest already?

12:21.130 --> 12:22.220
Dimple.

12:25.810 --> 12:27.470
Haven't seen you in a while...

12:38.480 --> 12:38.730
(Spirits and Such Consultation Office)

12:38.730 --> 12:40.480
(Saturday)
(Spirits and Such Consultation Office)

12:41.040 --> 12:43.960
So how's night school going, Serizawa?

12:44.750 --> 12:47.420
It's a bit nerve-racking,
but I think I'll make it through.

12:47.420 --> 12:51.790
I've sort of given up on making
friends, but I'll do my best.

12:54.210 --> 12:57.580
What about you, Mob?
Anything interesting lately?

12:58.110 --> 13:00.300
Yes, sort of...

13:00.680 --> 13:02.650
What is it? Tell us already.

13:03.240 --> 13:07.050
It's rare of you to ask us this
yourself, Master Reigen.

13:07.270 --> 13:10.180
There's so little going on
that I'm bored out of my mind.

13:10.180 --> 13:12.380
I mean, look at these jobs.

13:12.860 --> 13:15.240
We've got like four requests to find out

13:15.240 --> 13:19.250
if the sudden deterioration of some buildings
is due to some supernatural phenomena.

13:19.990 --> 13:23.700
They must've gotten the wong idea
that we just do odd jobs.

13:24.090 --> 13:25.650
I guess we don't just do odd jobs...

13:25.860 --> 13:30.100
I don't have any other work for you
two today, so you can go home.

13:30.610 --> 13:31.960
All right.

13:31.960 --> 13:33.110
Oh, wait a sec.

13:33.470 --> 13:36.470
That is, after I hear whatever interesting
thing is going on in your life, Mob.

13:39.080 --> 13:42.280
What? You think you've finally
become popular lately?

13:42.620 --> 13:45.580
Right. Welp, we're done for the day.
Good work, boys.

13:45.830 --> 13:47.630
If you'll excuse me.

13:48.700 --> 13:51.080
Oh, there's one other thing.

13:51.520 --> 13:55.020
Tomorrow, I'll be attending a gathering
for some religious group.

13:55.020 --> 13:58.090
Wha... Uh, are you okay with that?

13:58.670 --> 14:00.820
I got invited.

14:00.820 --> 14:04.320
Apparently, this group was formed
because of my actions,

14:04.320 --> 14:07.030
so they want me to be their founder.

14:08.150 --> 14:09.980
And are you going to be their founder?

14:10.280 --> 14:16.090
I could if I wanted to... But I should
probably meet everyone first.

14:16.330 --> 14:18.460
Good God, he's on a high horse.

14:19.100 --> 14:21.510
Psycho... what was it again?

14:21.510 --> 14:23.280
The Psycho Helmet Religion.

14:24.440 --> 14:26.060
Oh, here we go.

14:27.250 --> 14:29.000
Talk about half-assed...

14:30.190 --> 14:32.490
Yikes, don't do it, Mob.

14:32.490 --> 14:34.400
This is clearly shady as...

14:34.710 --> 14:35.380
Hm?

14:35.730 --> 14:39.920
580,000 believers?! It's that popular?!

14:39.920 --> 14:42.250
They've even got monetary donations...

14:42.610 --> 14:44.470
I-I...

14:44.470 --> 14:47.030
smell a delicious business
opportunity here.

14:49.590 --> 14:51.290
Go to that gathering!

14:51.640 --> 14:55.790
A true man should be the founder of
a religious group at least once!

14:55.790 --> 14:56.500
And!

14:56.810 --> 15:01.580
Make sure you tell your believers
that you have a master, too!

15:01.580 --> 15:02.470
Right...

15:02.790 --> 15:05.410
So, what are you going to wear?

15:05.410 --> 15:07.640
This is going to be your
time in the spotlight.

15:08.510 --> 15:09.340
Huh?

15:09.810 --> 15:12.010
Looks like they're going
to stream this online, too.

15:12.010 --> 15:15.310
There's going to be hundreds of
thousands of people watching you.

15:15.870 --> 15:17.880
What should I wear?

15:19.030 --> 15:21.360
Stick out your hands, Mob.

15:24.020 --> 15:27.590
Here's a bonus. Now go buy yourself
something nice to wear.

15:28.460 --> 15:29.640
Master!

15:30.340 --> 15:32.030
Thank you so much!

15:34.820 --> 15:36.643
I'm here to shop for clothes,

15:36.645 --> 15:40.051
but I have no idea what kind of clothes
to wear in the spotlight.

15:40.520 --> 15:42.890
I guess I'll go home and talk to Ritsu...

15:43.300 --> 15:44.690
Kageyama?

15:46.080 --> 15:47.740
It is you!

15:47.740 --> 15:49.050
Hanazawa!

15:50.670 --> 15:54.320
I see. Well, leave that to me.

15:54.740 --> 15:56.760
I know plenty of perfect shops.

15:57.220 --> 15:59.720
That's great! Thanks!

16:05.280 --> 16:08.150
I've been observing
what's going on in the city...

16:08.770 --> 16:11.400
but I guess you've noticed it, too.

16:12.130 --> 16:15.100
There's something gradually happening here.

16:16.070 --> 16:17.980
No, wait...

16:19.460 --> 16:21.160
Is there something going
on with those girls?

16:21.640 --> 16:22.700
Well...

16:23.260 --> 16:27.680
Lately, I feel like there are
a lot of girls staring at me.

16:27.910 --> 16:31.370
I know I probably have the wrong
idea, but it's been on my mind.

16:31.750 --> 16:33.330
Oho...

16:33.720 --> 16:34.840
Kageyama...

16:35.110 --> 16:37.280
That's not a misunderstanding.

16:37.280 --> 16:41.300
You're just so cool that the girls
can't help but look your way.

16:41.560 --> 16:43.730
No way. That can't be true...

16:44.110 --> 16:47.900
That can't be true... or is it?

16:48.190 --> 16:49.660
Aw, shucks.

16:50.360 --> 16:52.390
Let's just leave it at that.

16:52.780 --> 16:55.370
Come on. Let's get you some hip clothes.

16:55.370 --> 16:56.690
Okay!

16:59.000 --> 17:01.290
Hey, this will probably look good.

17:01.570 --> 17:04.460
Oh, but this is above my budget.

17:04.460 --> 17:07.780
I see.
Well, everything here is a bit pricey.

17:08.520 --> 17:12.040
How about this? This is a super-popular
brand called Smart Monkey.

17:12.040 --> 17:15.240
If possible, I'd like to keep
it under or at 5,000 yen.

17:15.240 --> 17:17.000
Okay, I'm sure we'll find something.

17:17.620 --> 17:19.220
Hm? Here we go!

17:19.480 --> 17:22.680
This also has a monkey design
and it's 5,000 yen on the dot.

17:22.680 --> 17:25.140
Yay! Let's go with that.

17:25.490 --> 17:27.590
Thanks, Hanazawa-kun.

17:31.070 --> 17:32.270
Nii-san...

17:32.490 --> 17:34.570
Are you gonna go out wearing that?

17:34.850 --> 17:37.770
Yup! Hanazawa helped me pick this out.

17:38.200 --> 17:41.130
Right... I see.

17:41.410 --> 17:42.340
Okay.

17:45.170 --> 17:46.680
But you know...

17:47.350 --> 17:49.070
I'm seeing Tome this afternoon,

17:49.070 --> 17:50.770
and then Mezato tonight.

17:51.260 --> 17:52.660
I'm so busy.

17:55.960 --> 17:57.730
Tome's a bit late...

18:02.270 --> 18:05.530
I was so worried that I just didn't
really get it in the end...

18:06.200 --> 18:09.640
But is this shirt really that cool?

18:15.990 --> 18:17.860
She's not answering her phone either.

18:18.260 --> 18:21.050
I wonder if something happened to Tome.

18:22.910 --> 18:27.700
Anyone auditioning, please head on in.

18:27.700 --> 18:31.420
The emergence of the Divine Tree
is a message from the Earth.

18:31.420 --> 18:33.870
The Divine Tree is the
legendary dragon's nest.

18:34.210 --> 18:36.840
The Divine Tree is a sign
that nature is angry...

18:38.340 --> 18:43.930
As if any of these shady religious organizations
can handle the true powers of the Divine Tree.

18:45.830 --> 18:50.800
We, the Rising Sun Spiritual
Union, shall look after it.

18:50.800 --> 18:54.720
Please speak of these
things further inside.

18:54.720 --> 18:56.600
I'll walk you down.

19:00.230 --> 19:02.910
There are so many people here.

19:02.910 --> 19:07.130
The Psycho Helmet Religion
is partially a joke, right?

19:07.130 --> 19:09.420
So where'd all these people come from?

19:09.420 --> 19:12.080
There's not going to be a riot, is there?

19:12.080 --> 19:16.300
Don't worry.
Let's believe in what he says.

19:17.200 --> 19:21.000
In our founder who suddenly
showed himself yesterday.

19:21.570 --> 19:26.410
And the one who speaks for the
Divine Tree, Psycho Helmet-sama.

19:27.240 --> 19:30.756
We tried calling
the number you have dialed,

19:30.758 --> 19:32.800
but the call cannot be completed.

19:32.800 --> 19:35.100
Mezato-san's not answering...

19:36.060 --> 19:38.490
She hasn't even told me
where everyone's meeting yet.

19:39.310 --> 19:41.040
I guess I'll wait a little longer.

19:45.490 --> 19:46.770
Yowch.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.540
Mob sure is taking his time to appear.

19:51.230 --> 19:53.460
Did he chicken out?

19:54.540 --> 19:59.040
Oh, there he is.
Well, he seems pretty confident.

19:59.050 --> 20:03.010
(Psycho Helmet Religion)

20:03.670 --> 20:06.020
It's a pleasure to meet you, everyone.

20:06.480 --> 20:10.970
I will be the one who will serve
as the founder of this religion,

20:10.970 --> 20:13.280
Psycho Helmet.

20:13.280 --> 20:15.290
What the hell? That's not Mob.

20:15.770 --> 20:17.680
The hell's going on?

20:18.940 --> 20:20.690
Damn it, his phone's out of battery.

20:23.030 --> 20:25.660
But with the terrorist
attack the other day,

20:25.660 --> 20:29.880
I have realized that we need
someone to protect this city.

20:30.230 --> 20:34.640
From now on, I will be the one who
will lead everyone to happiness.

20:35.090 --> 20:41.100
I plan to change this degenerate world
along with the Psycho Helmet Religion.

20:42.780 --> 20:44.520
My battery's dead.

20:44.520 --> 20:48.950
I am also the creator of the Divine Tree.

20:48.950 --> 20:53.790
It is the symbol of the Psycho Helmet
Religion and its carefree nature.

20:53.790 --> 20:57.199
The Divine Tree
grows with everyone's desires

20:57.201 --> 20:59.590
and will bring the world happiness.

20:59.590 --> 21:02.220
Please think of that tree as me

21:03.590 --> 21:06.270
and continue praying to it.

21:06.270 --> 21:09.078
Objection! The Divine Tree is the
egg in which the great Mossar-sama sleeps!

21:09.080 --> 21:10.740
O Divine Tree! Please quell your rage!

21:10.740 --> 21:14.210
That's also wrong! The Divine Tree
is the mecca for the Dragon's Sigh!

21:14.210 --> 21:15.310
Psycho helmet, my ass! You fake religion!

21:15.310 --> 21:16.460
-Yeesh...
Psycho helmet, my ass! You fake religion!

21:16.460 --> 21:16.760
That is a device that connects dimensions!

21:16.760 --> 21:18.550
-Things are getting interesting.
That is a device that connects dimensions!

21:18.550 --> 21:20.566
Quit lying!

21:20.568 --> 21:24.771
The Divine Tree will only bring about
happiness under our supervision!

21:25.290 --> 21:26.900
I will now show you...

21:27.910 --> 21:29.720
...a miracle.

21:40.640 --> 21:41.610
Huh?!

21:41.610 --> 21:42.850
It's a broccoli!

21:42.850 --> 21:43.870
Bro...

21:43.870 --> 21:46.910
What the heck just happened?!

21:55.940 --> 22:00.780
The blue light shined
Dazzling my eye at 01:30 AM

22:00.820 --> 22:06.160
Even as I swiped the page over,
The smiles of friends besides me remain

22:16.170 --> 22:18.590
Yes, I want someone to understand

22:18.590 --> 22:21.090
All the colorless and transparent wishes

22:21.090 --> 22:23.590
All the breath stuck within
The depth of my heart

22:23.590 --> 22:26.220
Suddenly flowed out
Bringing my consciousness back

22:26.220 --> 22:28.680
I remember the days hung dry

22:28.680 --> 22:31.180
The very normal days passed by

22:31.180 --> 22:33.650
Even if reality is corrupted

22:33.650 --> 22:36.400
The sky we saw together
Was definitely real

22:36.980 --> 22:41.110
It's harder to understand than
The grammar on the blackboard

22:41.110 --> 22:46.320
The story that disappears
Under 24 hours makes me sad and lonely

22:46.590 --> 22:50.790
It's so hard, and I find myself
On the verge of giving up again and again

22:50.790 --> 22:52.330
But I...

22:53.160 --> 22:56.500
The current me will no longer give up

22:56.630 --> 23:01.510
Overflowing emotions on my sleeve,
Running through worry and doubt

23:01.510 --> 23:04.138
Nobody has decided
if the future is 0 or 100,

23:04.140 --> 23:06.720
So I'll paint over them myself

23:06.720 --> 23:09.104
Even if my existence itself
can't be proven,

23:09.106 --> 23:12.141
If this world struck me in my heart

23:12.270 --> 23:14.810
I will flood it with cobalt blue

23:26.130 --> 23:27.040
This isn't good, Mob!

23:27.040 --> 23:29.320
We're gonna be outta business
because of that broccoli!

23:29.320 --> 23:31.020
Who cares if it's holy or popular?

23:31.020 --> 23:32.430
We're gonna go destroy it!

23:32.430 --> 23:34.400
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 III Episode 4:

23:34.400 --> 23:36.260
"Divine Tree 1 ~The Founder Appears~"

23:36.260 --> 23:39.480
A streaming service? But of course,
that's an excellent decision!
